tengine/godot/pull/97845\r\n\r\nCompared to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97845 this PR re-introduces `engine_version` to `VisualShader` resource to properly upgrade old visual shaders, so there is no compatibility breakage.\r\n\r\nAdded to Fragment Shader Mode Output:\r\n\r\n- TANGENT\r\n- BINORMAL\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_COLOR\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_DEPTH\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_BOOST\r\n- FOG\r\n- RADIANCE\r\n- IRRADIANCE\r\n\r\nAdded to Vertex Shader Inputs:\r\n\r\n- BONE_INDICES (transformed to vec4 from uvec4)\r\n- BONE_WEIGHTS\r\n- MAIN_CAM_INV_VIEW_MATRIX\r\n- POSITION\r\n\r\nAdded Fragment Shader Output:\r\n\r\n- POSITION\r\n\r\nUnsupported:\r\n\r\n- MODEL_NORMAL_MATRIX\r\n- MODELVIEW_NORMAL_MATRIX\r\n\r\n(They are using `mat3` type, which is unsupported by visual shader).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg="